            "__v": 1,
            "description": "Stanza living- Tamarindo is a phenomenal living space for boys located on Housr road Bangalore nearest to the electronic city metro station. This rental living space offers double and triple sharing rooms equipped with comfortable box beds, classy cupboards, wall decorations, a spacious kitchen and a lot more. It's convenient and comfortable for the short term, one day trip or long haul; Additional supplementary services are also provided to you like strong security, refrigerator, smart TV, attached bathroom, kitchen, AC, side table and a lot more. Besides, the joined restroom is totally fitted with a fountain, shower, Hot/cold water supply and other incredible fittings. Located in the smart city- of Bangalore, stanza living provides you with all three times meals (breakfast, lunch and dinner) or you can prepare meals in a separate common kitchen. This living space is ideal for graduates, experts, working employees on account of the presence of various business work environments, retail outlets, markets, food courts and so on. There are no restrictions over guest timings, your companions or relatives can stay with you whenever. Do not wait anymore. Book now",
