            "description": "<p>Stanza living- Lucena is one of the coolest living spaces open for men and women offering double and triple sharing rooms in a budget-friendly manner. Located in Housr road, Bangalore, this living accommodation easily connects metropolis Bangalore and industrial city housr with smooth connectivity of transport. It offers all complimentary facilities like high-speed wifi, housekeeping, CCTV, fridge, smart TV, bathroom, lounge, side table, Induction, and significantly more. Along with luxury facilities, the total space has a lovely interior, comfortable beds, wooden furnishings, comfortable sitting spaces like couches and sofas, a savvy dining area, Plus an open room gallery with a lot of vegetation and plants. Healthy and fresh meals are served to you including breakfast, lunch and dinner or you can prepare your own favourite dish in a common kitchen with basic appliances like a refrigerator, Induction, Microwave. Situated in an ideal spot, this living space is 10-15 away from shopping malls, markets, medical, grocery stores and well-known food cafes like citrus caf&eacute;, bamboo heights, sheesha lounge, Madurai caf&eacute; and more. Come and join us in this well furnished coliving space. For more details, feel free to contact us. Book now!</p>\n",
