            "__v": 0,
            "description": "Speilberg House is not for those who are in search of a traditional PG in Bangalore with a hefty brokerage, rent space, and no such exclusive amenities.  After all, Speilberg is your second family, not just a regular PG, and offers fully-furnished and well-equipped rooms. They offer its residents all the comforts which they are accustomed to at home. This beautifully designed living space for girls is located in Koramangala, Bangalore, and just a few minutes away from Indiranagar metro station, shopper stop, and christ university.  Spielberg House offers professional services such as high-speed internet, security, Wi-Fi, washing machine, attached bathroom, kitchen, geyser, microwave, induction, power-backup, lift, lounge, and more. Moreover, they serve freshly homecooked food including all the 3 meals ie Breakfast, Lunch & dinner. Speilberg gives its residents a sense of belongingness, attachment, and warmth you get at your home.  Visit your second home and discover what makes it so special.",
