            "description": "Located in HSR Layout Bangalore, Settl Sofia is a vibrant and elegant coliving space. It is located near Mcdonald's signal, BDA Complex. If you are looking for fully-furnished 1BHK apartments and studios then this one is the best coliving space. Experience communal living with all the modern-day amenities in this well-built coliving space. It is known for its affordability and well-maintained rooms. You will be provided with Wi-Fi, power backup, housekeeping service, power supply, water supply, high-level security, washing machine, TV, attached washroom, microwave, induction and much more. It is easily connected to the main road for day-to-day life shopping. ",
