            "description": "<p>Are you looking for a living space in Bangalore? Welcome to Settl.Hallstatt located near Divyashree Tech park on Whitefield Main Road, Bangalore. It is a comfortable, safe and lively living space providing affordable private and sharing rooms. It is a well-furnished coliving property equipped with modern amenities such as wifi, on-site laundry facilities, regular cleaning and maintenance, tech-enabled security, networking opportunities, seamless connectivity and much more. So many community-hosted events and gatherings are organized occasionally for entertainment. There are common areas where you can chill and hangout with the fellow residents. This coliving space is thoughtfully designed for the millennial generation. Book now!</p>\n",
