            "description": "Welcome to HelloWorld 18th Main, a premium living space located in Sector-3, HSR Layout in Bangalore. This fully-furnished coliving space offers spacious and well-equipped single and double sharing rooms. You will be provided with clean rooms with proper ventilation and premium services. It boasts state of the art amenities such as daily housekeeping, fast-speed internet access, modern furniture, geyser, attached bathroom, side table, cupboard, comfortable mattresses, air conditioning, high-level security and much more. It has easy access to high-end hospitals, luxury hotels, banks, prestigious educational institutions, restaurants, ATMs, parks etc. All modes of public transport are easily available at a reasonable price. Book your bed now!",
